{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜蓋茨警告AI衝擊就業 大量職位恐永久消失           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">微軟共同創辦人蓋茨警告，人工智能正推動一場動盪的勞動市場轉型，許多職位將在約十年間永遠消失。他預期法律、客戶服務、醫療、軟件及製造業等工作會受影響，並主張部分工種應保留予人類。Challenger, Gray &amp; Christmas資料顯示，2026年以來有121,401個裁員公告提及AI，佔全部裁員約20%。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:05:18.543701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T19:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:53.227044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:53.227044+00:00","content_hash":"8e425402066e32eaac3f47c71b32458cc7f735a1a2535b8ba1187ec2a8bfa1ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}